Package: flyos-recovery
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Fly OS Project <devnull@example.invalid>
Depends: flyos-core (= @VERSION@), apt, systemd, pkexec, util-linux
Recommends: btrfs-progs, snapper, rsync, kup-backup
Replaces: flyos-base (<< 0.6.0~), flyos-update (<< 0.6.0-alpha2~)
Breaks: flyos-base (<< 0.6.0~), flyos-update (<< 0.6.0-alpha2~)
Description: Fly OS recovery, snapshot and offline-update engine
 Provides Btrfs/Snapper integration, repair tools, backup entry points and the
 systemd offline update transaction used by Fly Update.
